    {
        "content": "<p>The \"build Mathlib\" step in CI shows lines like</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Text only\"><pre><span></span><code>  ✔ [8482/18125] Built Mathlib.Combinatorics.Enumerative.Catalan.Basic (3.3s)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I'm used to seeing something around 9000 for the number of jobs (and Mathlib seems to have 8645 .lean files right now). What happened?</p>",
        "id": 632581132,
        "sender_full_name": "Michael Stoll",
        "timestamp": 1792253665
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I counted the file and there are less than 9K files in mathlib. Claude says</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">There</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">aren't</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">18</span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">files</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">The</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">number</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">N</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lake's</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">count</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">build</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">jobs</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">creates</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">two</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">jobs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">every</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">module</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Foo</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">elaborates</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">replays</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">its</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">olean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cache</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Lake</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">Build</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">Module</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">1141</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v4</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">36</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">rc1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">toolchain</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Foo</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">irArts</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">code</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">generation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">artifacts</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Module</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">1301</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Building</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">library</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fetches</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">this</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">every</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">module</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Build</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">Library</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">79</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">It</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">does</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">real</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">work</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">when</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">compiler</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">postponeCompile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">set</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">otherwise</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">log</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">shows</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">it</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Ran</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Foo</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">irArts</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
